{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Missing that classic Zelda feel?</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Legends of Tynedale</strong> delivers intricate dungeons, rewarding exploration, challenging puzzles, and memorable boss battles \u2014 a love letter to the era of <i>Link\u2019s Awakening</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/0677edc2241855ee074b40fff0437a25.poster.avif?t=1768507440\" width=528 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/0677edc2241855ee074b40fff0437a25.webm?t=1768507440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/0677edc2241855ee074b40fff0437a25.mp4?t=1768507440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a handcrafted pixel-art world where curiosity is rewarded and every new tool reshapes how you explore. You play as <strong>Geordie</strong>, a young adventurer determined to complete the quest his grandfather never could. What begins as a simple journey soon leads into forgotten ruins, dangerous dungeons, and a dark secret buried deep beneath the land of Tynedale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a classic top-down action-adventure built around tight progression, deliberate pacing, and thoughtful design \u2014 inspired by the golden age of dungeon-driven exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/23ec07963ec5a64c95df563dc52736d5.poster.avif?t=1768507440\" width=570 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/23ec07963ec5a64c95df563dc52736d5.webm?t=1768507440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/23ec07963ec5a64c95df563dc52736d5.mp4?t=1768507440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Handcrafted World</strong><br>Journey through a vibrant pixel-art realm filled with hidden paths, secrets, and optional discoveries. As you gain new abilities, previously unreachable areas gradually open up, encouraging exploration and backtracking in classic fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer Puzzle-Focused Dungeons</strong><br>Each dungeon is a carefully designed puzzle box, built around lock-and-key progression, environmental challenges, and clever riddles. Observation and problem-solving are just as important as combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Monsters and Bosses</strong><br>Face a wide variety of enemies and formidable bosses that demand strategy, timing, and mastery of your tools. Every major encounter is designed to feel earned \u2014 and memorable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Weapons, Tools, and Abilities</strong><br>Discover and master new equipment that expands both combat and exploration, opening new routes through the world and new solutions to old problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Lore of Tynedale</strong><br>Piece together the land\u2019s history through environmental storytelling, hidden secrets, and subtle narrative details as you unravel the truth behind your grandfather\u2019s unfinished quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Legends of Tynedale</strong> is a focused, single-player adventure for fans of classic action-adventure games \u2014 where discovery matters, dungeons feel meaningful, and progression is always earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/57bce14fa0f8e6625e9496bcc88d8229.poster.avif?t=1768507440\" width=570 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/57bce14fa0f8e6625e9496bcc88d8229.webm?t=1768507440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/57bce14fa0f8e6625e9496bcc88d8229.mp4?t=1768507440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ashington Mines Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1417590/1540383089b54e34a358f429f67203ca19389bf7.jpg"},{"name":"Catacombs Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1417590/9260a128c0325a7066019aafb8a33f4ea71eda59.jpg"},{"name":"Spindleston Heugh Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1417590/8e3cb2751526a0e2b0dd02a0ca2492a5566d353e.jpg"},{"name":"Feel the Love","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1417590/e43c3d0ff632ff6890c9fe49540d2ab759bc918c.jpg"},{"name":"Who was that guy?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1417590/420640bad2ddf7c66ae4e5cc677f1268966425d8.jpg"},{"name":"Unlocked the Dreadnought","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1417590/d6a449ca14b3eea9d345e203f757c62f164f4241.jpg"},{"name":"Opened Pandora's Box","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1417590/9b25bee2aa04acbee88c0fe81909cd4a12afa15c.jpg"},{"name":"Map Translated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1417590/a67f64954ac5b272653625b2317748f67649aaac.jpg"},{"name":"Bede's Burnt Out Robes","path":"htt